3b0f6b28ac5eceb5000f09126ae7f36.mp4?t=1757405952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ultimate goal? Construct a towering lighthouse to signal for help and secure your escape. Each resource you gather, from wood to stone, plays a crucial role in building a sturdy, weather-resistant tower as you face the challenges of the island environment. With vibrant, cartoony visuals and an intuitive crafting interface, <i><strong>IslaNode</strong></i> combines the thrill of survival with the satisfaction of creative construction.</p>","developers":["Gor Yeritsyan"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3233250/636e5ca7a8507af14b519f036ec41f96fbef1b8b/header.jpg?t=1757405952","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257100014,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100014/movie480.mp4?t=1740329098","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100014/movie_max.mp4?t=1740329098"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257100014/5e475349153b34afdcc7f7ec7701fbf2bd091558/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740329098","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100014/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740329098","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257100014/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740329098"}}],"name":"IslaNode Rescue Signal","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 6